</div></p>
<p><strong>BUUCTF: <a href="https://buuoj.cn/challenges"target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">https://buuoj.cn/challenges</a></strong></p>
<hr>
<p>相关阅读
<a href="https://ctf-wiki.org/"target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">CTF Wiki</a>
<a href="https://blog.csdn.net/weixin_34979095/article/details/142429105"target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">buuctf-voip两种解题思路酷软BUZZ再现</a></p>
<p>
<div class="post-img-view">
    <a data-fancybox="gallery" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/yuexuan521/image/20251228190333154.png">
        <img src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/yuexuan521/image/20251228190333154.png" 
             alt="在这里插入图片描述" 
              
             loading="lazy"
        />
    </a>
</div></p>
<h3 id="题目描述">题目描述：</h3>
<p>注意：得到的 flag 请包上 flag{} 提交</p>
<h3 id="密文">密文：</h3>
<p>下载附件，解压得到voip.pcap</p>
<p>
<div class="post-img-view">
    <a data-fancybox="gallery" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/yuexuan521/image/20251228190334538.png">
        <img src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/yuexuan521/image/20251228190334538.png" 
             alt="在这里插入图片描述" 
              
             loading="lazy"
        />
    </a>
</div></p>
<hr>
<h3 id="解题思路">解题思路：</h3>
<p>1、根据题目得知，本题与VoIP有关。</p>
<blockquote>
<p><strong>基于IP的语音传输</strong> （英语：Voice over Internet Protocol，缩写为 <strong>VoIP</strong> ）是一种语音通话技术，经由网际协议（IP）来达成语音通话与多媒体会议，也就是经由互联网来进行通信。其他非正式的名称有IP电话（IP telephony）、互联网电话（Internet telephony）、宽带电话（broadband telephony）以及宽带电话服务（broadband phone service）。
VoIP可用于包括VoIP电话、智能手机、个人计算机在内的诸多互联网接入设备，通过蜂窝网络、Wi-Fi进行通话及发送短信。</p>
</blockquote>
<p>打开voip.pcap，发现大量RTP流量</p>
<blockquote>
<p><strong>RTP定义</strong> ：Real-time Transport Protocol，是由IETF的多媒体传输工作小组于1996年在RFC 1889中公布的。RTP为IP上的语音、图像等需要实时传输的多媒体数据提供端对端的传输服务，但本身无法保证服务质量（QoS），因此，需要配合实时传输控制协议（RTCP）一起使用。</p>
</blockquote>
<p>
<div class="post-img-view">
    <a data-fancybox="gallery" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/yuexuan521/image/20251228190335591.png">
        <img src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/yuexuan521/image/20251228190335591.png" 
             alt="在这里插入图片描述" 
              
             loading="lazy"
        />
    </a>
</div></p>
<p>WireShark可以播放VoIP通话流量，选择 <code>主菜单-&gt;电话-&gt;VoIP通话</code></p>
<p>
<div class="post-img-view">
    <a data-fancybox="gallery" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/yuexuan521/image/20251228190337627.png">
        <img src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/yuexuan521/image/20251228190337627.png" 
             alt="在这里插入图片描述" 
              
             loading="lazy"
        />
    </a>
</div></p>
<p>选择VoIP呼叫，点击 <code>Play Streams</code></p>
<p>
<div class="post-img-view">
    <a data-fancybox="gallery" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/yuexuan521/image/20251228190339412.png">
        <img src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/yuexuan521/image/20251228190339412.png" 
             alt="在这里插入图片描述" 
              
             loading="lazy"
        />
    </a>
</div></p>
<p>右键选择 <code>Play/Pause</code> ，播放音频。听英语听力，获得flag。</p>
<p>
<div class="post-img-view">
    <a data-fancybox="gallery" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/yuexuan521/image/20251228190341374.png">
        <img src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/yuexuan521/image/20251228190341374.png" 
             alt="在这里插入图片描述" 
              
             loading="lazy"
        />
    </a>
</div></p>
<p>2、也可以直接选择 <code>主菜单-&gt;电话-&gt;RTP-&gt;RTP流</code> ，来播放音频，步骤相同。</p>
<p>
<div class="post-img-view">
    <a data-fancybox="gallery" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/yuexuan521/image/20251228190343470.png">
        <img src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/yuexuan521/image/20251228190343470.png" 
             alt="在这里插入图片描述" 
              
             loading="lazy"
        />
    </a>
</div></p>
<p>因为我实在听不出来，音频的内容是是什么。所以，我使用Buzz工具将音频转换为文本，得到flag。</p>
<p>Buzz下载地址： <a href="https://github.com/chidiwilliams/buzz/releases"target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">https://github.com/chidiwilliams/buzz/releases</a></p>
<p>流程如下：</p>
<p>导出wav音频文件</p>
<p>
<div class="post-img-view">
    <a data-fancybox="gallery" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/yuexuan521/image/20251228190345304.png">
        <img src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/yuexuan521/image/20251228190345304.png" 
             alt="在这里插入图片描述" 
              
             loading="lazy"
        />
    </a>
</div></p>
<p>将导出的wav音频文件，拖入Buzz中，选择中型语音库 <code>Medium</code> ，开始执行。</p>
<p>
<div class="post-img-view">
    <a data-fancybox="gallery" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/yuexuan521/image/20251228190348377.png">
        <img src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/yuexuan521/image/20251228190348377.png" 
             alt="在这里插入图片描述" 
              
             loading="lazy"
        />
    </a>
</div></p>
<p>得到文本如下：</p>
<div class="highlight"><div class="chroma">
<table class="lntable"><tr><td class="lntd">
<pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code><span class="lnt">1
</span><span class="lnt">2
</span></code></pre></td>
<td class="lntd">
<pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"><span class="line"><span class="cl">Hi, this is 2nd IVR service. Please press <span class="m">1</span> to listen to the flag. Press <span class="m">9</span> to exit.
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">The flag is S-E-C-C-O-N-OPEN-BRACE-900-1-I-V-R-CLOSE-BRACE. Only capital letters, no spaces are used. Thank you.
</span></span></code></pre></td></tr></table>
</div>
</div><p>
<div class="post-img-view">
    <a data-fancybox="gallery" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/yuexuan521/image/20251228190349700.png">
        <img src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/yuexuan521/image/20251228190349700.png" 
             alt="在这里插入图片描述" 
              
             loading="lazy"
        />
    </a>
</div></p>
<h3 id="flag">flag：</h3>
<div class="highlight"><div class="chroma">
<table class="lntable"><tr><td class="lntd">
<pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code><span class="lnt">1
</span></code></pre></td>
<td class="lntd">
<pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"><span class="line"><span class="cl">flag<span class="o">{</span>9001IVR<span class="o">}</span>
</span></span></code></pre></td></tr></table>
</div>
</div>]]></content:encoded>
